- Read completed 8388608/8388608 bytes (100 %), one shot, no errors.
- File: backup/esp32s3-epaper154-full-flash-2026-06-29.bin (8,388,608 bytes).
- Sanity: first bytes "e9 04 02 2f" — e9 is the ESP image magic, so a real
